      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANJO STATUE (1) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 0.8 lengths into second (17.74) at this track in a Grade 4 over 324m. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Expected to feature in the finish again. PONY TAIL (4) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Finished second latest over 324m at this track (18.04) in a Grade 3/4. Has a good record here at this journey including seven wins. Will give a great sight again. ZIPPING SAIGO (8) could not have been more impressive last start in her fast 17.64 win at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 324m. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. SAJA BOY (7) will be hard to beat despite making his debut at this circuit.",
